Building from source
--------------------
First, install the required prerequisite libraries, which are the
development versions of GTK 3 (3.12 or newer) and GLib 2. On Fedora, these
packages are gtk3-devel and glib2-devel; on Debian and Ubuntu, libgtk-3-dev.

Then use autoreconf to invoke the various parts of the GNU Build system:
     autoreconf -i

Then build:
     ./configure
     make
